[size=5][b]AI disclosure[/b][/size]

This mod was made with the assistance of Claude (Fable 5, Opus 5, Opus 4.8) and ChatGPT 5.6 Sol for coding, including modifying garment meshes to fit alternative body shapes, and documentation drafting.  No textures or artwork were generated by AI. The concept, scope, steering, design, and significant architecture choices are the human author's, as is all in-game testing and debugging. (In other words — Claude is great, but it's still a helluva lot of work.)
